{"id":"631846","name":"肉粽","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/631846/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"1500克"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"800克"}],"sub":[{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用碱","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉切成薄片，加盐、耗油、生抽、老抽、糖、米酒拌匀。","img":"images/631846/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"桂皮，八角、香叶打成粉，再加适量的油拌匀。","img":"images/631846/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"腌2个小时，肉就好了。","img":"images/631846/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备好糯米。","img":"images/631846/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"清洗干净，沥干水分。","img":"images/631846/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加半勺生抽、一勺老抽、适量的盐、两勺食用油、一丢丢食用碱拌匀。","img":"images/631846/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取两片粽叶(粽叶提前清洗干净)，首尾重叠，折一个漏斗。","img":"images/631846/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加米。","img":"images/631846/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加肉。","img":"images/631846/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再加满米。","img":"images/631846/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"折一下。","img":"images/631846/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用粽绳扎紧。","img":"images/631846/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"依次全部做完。","img":"images/631846/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"修剪掉多余的边边，整理一下。","img":"images/631846/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包好的粽子。","img":"images/631846/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入高压锅，加满没过粽子的水，大火烧开，转中小火压3~4个小时。","img":"images/631846/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/631846/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631846/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631846/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"满满的肉香。","img":"images/631846/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}